{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-034.md","record_count":65,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"டேய் நில்லு. அங்கே யாரு பாபுவா? ஏன் பாபு ஒன் நிலமை இப்படி யாச்சு. எதுக்காக இந்த வீட்டுமேலே இப்ப ஏறுனே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நிறுத்து. வீட்டு மேலே ஏறது--செவுறு ஏறி குதிக்கிறது--அதல்லாம் ஒன் பழக்கம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ என்ன சொல்றே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அன்னைக்கு ராத்திரி ஏன் திருட்டுத்தனமா எங்க வீட்டுல நுழைஞ்ச?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதுவா?...அது நாயி.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யார்ரா நாய்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பாபு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னபாபு...பாபுவாம்ல பாபு...பெரிய யோக்யன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பாபு இப்பநான் ஒங்கிட்டே என்ன கேட்டேன்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞானக்கண்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னம்மா அது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஒண்ணுமில்லேப்பா. யாரோ ரெண்டுபேரு தெருவிலே சண்டை போட்டுகிட்டு இருக்காங்க.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதெல்லாம் சகஜந்தாம்மா. யாராவது போக்கிரிங்க குடிக்கத்தெரியாம குடிச்சிபிட்டு உருளுவாங்க,","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":49,"printed_page":48}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இல்லப்பா--நம்ப வீட்டுக்கு நேராவே சண்டை போடுறாங்க.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நம்ப வீடென்ன, சப்இன்ஸ்பெக்டர் வீடா? அவுங்க பாட்டுக்கு உருளட்டும். நீ ஏம்மா அங்கெல்லாம் போறே. போ, படுத்துத் தூங்கு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தம்பி, பாத்தியா? பாத்தியா? ஓடிட்டான்--ஆமா நீ என்ன தம்பி என்னையே அடிச்சுட்டே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இரு கொண்டாரேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யாரது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யாருமில்லேப்பா--அட வீட்டுக்குள்ளேயே வந்துட்டியா?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஹீ...ஹீ...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யாரு? என்ன?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஊங்...யாரோ ஒரு பாவிப் பய இவனை அடிச்சி போட்டுட்டு போயிட்டான். ரொம்ப களைப்பா இருக்காம்; கொஞ்சம் தண்ணி வேணும்னு கேட்டாரு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சரி...சரி. சீக்கிரம் தண்ணி கொடுத்து, வெளியே அனுப்பு--ஏன் வம்பை எல்லாம் வெலைக்கு வாங்குறே.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சரி--சரி, உட்காருப்பா.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அடி பலந்தானாய்யா?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! அடி ஒண்ணும் பலமில்லே--கடிதான் கொஞ்சம் பலம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கடிச்சுட்டானு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஊம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d028","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யோ, பாவம். இந்த காலத்திலே நாய்கூட பல்லை உபயோகிக்கிறதில்லே--மனுஷன் தான் ரொம்ப கெட்டுட்டான், சே...சே...சே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d029","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாங்க, இந்தப் பசங்களுக்கெல்லாம் சோறு கெடைக்கலேன்னா...மனுஷனைத்தான் கடிப்பானுங்க...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d030","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம். இந்தாயா, தண்ணி.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":50,"printed_page":49}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d031","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யய்யோ, இது என்னு இது...தண்ணிலே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d032","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பூச்சியா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d033","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னு பூச்சிப்பா?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d034","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ. அது தெரியலியே, முகத்தை காட்டமாட்டேங்குதே...ராத்திரி வேலையா இருக்கிறதுனாலே அது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d035","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சரி பார்த்து சாப்பிடு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d036","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ. பார்த்துத்தான் நானு. (முகத்தில் ஊற்றிக் கொள்கிறான்.)","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d037","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னாது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d038","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தண்ணி...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d039","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ...அந்தக் கடிக்கு போய் மருந்துபோட்டுக்க!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d040","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இங்க வாப்பா, கைக்கு மருந்து போடுறேன்...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d041","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"போப்பா! போய் போட்டுக்க, பாம்பு பல்லைவிட மனுஷன் பல்லுக்குத்தான் விஷம் அதிகம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d042","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மனுஷாள் கண்ணுக்குக்கூட விஷம் அதிகம்தான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d043","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யாரு பிள்ளையாண்டான், கண் ஆஸ்பத்திரி டாக்டரோ.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d044","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ...தம்பீ!...என்ன பண்றே? மெள்ள...அய்யோ, மெள்ள தம்பி, சண்டையிலே எப்படி நாக்கவுட்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d045","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யாரு கொடுத்தது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d046","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அவன் கொடுத்தான்! அதா...வச்சிருக்கானே! ஆமா தம்பீ, நீங்க ரெண்டுபேருந்தான் தனியா இருக்கீங்களா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d047","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமா...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d048","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆகாம்...தனியா இருக்கீங்களா...? உனக்கு இன்னும் கலியாணம் ஆகல போலருக்கு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d049","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உனக்கெப்படித் தெரியும்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d050","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அது எனக்கு எப்படித் தெரியும்னா அது...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d051","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆம்பளையெல்லாம் கழுத்திலே தாலியா போட்டுட்டு இருப்பாங்க, நீ பாத்த ஒண்ணு கல்யாணம் ஆச்சா இல்லையான்னு கண்டுபிடிக்க...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d052","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! ஆம்பளை! ஏன் தம்பீ இவ்வளவு வளத்து இருக்கே...? [தலைமுடியைக் காட்டுகிறான்.]","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d053","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! இதுவா? இது ஒரு வேண்டுதலை...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d054","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! வேண்டுதலையா...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d055","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்பா...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d056","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யய்யோ! நீவேற கட் பண்ணாதே...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":51,"printed_page":50}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d057","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இதுதான் வழி, போய்ட்டு வர்ரியா...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":52,"printed_page":51}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d058","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":52,"printed_page":51}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d059","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இனிமே வெளியே கிளம்பும்போது துணையோடே கிளம்புங்க!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":52,"printed_page":51}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d060","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அந்தத் துணையும் உன் மாதிரி கிடைச்சால்ல நல்லா இருக்கும்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":52,"printed_page":51}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d061","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வணக்கம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":52,"printed_page":51}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d062","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பெரியவரே!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":52,"printed_page":51}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d063","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னப்பா...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":52,"printed_page":51}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d064","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நான் போய்ட்டு வர்ரேன்! ஒங்க ஒதவிக்கும் ஒங்க பிள்ளையோட ஒதவிக்கும் ரொம்ப நன்றி வர்ரேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":52,"printed_page":51}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s034-d065","scene_id":"raja-rani-s034","scene_ordinal":34,"transition_audit_id":"T034","speaker_label":"ஞான","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன பிள்ளையா? பெண்ணைப் போயி பிள்ளை இங்கிறான்! ஒருவேளை இவனும் என்னைப் போல குருடனா இருப்பானோ?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":52,"printed_page":51}],"source_scene_file":"scene-034.md"}]}
